WEBVTT

00:00.720 --> 00:01.680
Your son thinks

00:01.760 --> 00:03.680
We could reduce elder brother's privileges

00:03.760 --> 00:04.920
As punishment

00:05.000 --> 00:05.920
At the same time

00:06.000 --> 00:07.240
Pacify the refugees

00:07.320 --> 00:08.987
And accelerate the canal's progress

00:09.080 --> 00:10.400
Speed it up

00:10.480 --> 00:10.960
Your son and others

00:11.040 --> 00:12.440
No matter how hard

00:12.560 --> 00:14.893
Will help Father complete the canal quickly

00:15.000 --> 00:16.400
Good

00:16.600 --> 00:17.760
Good

00:17.840 --> 00:19.240
Very good
